[1mBUG REPORTS[0m
       If  you  find  a bug in [1mreadline[22m, you should report it.  But first, you
       should make sure that it really is a bug, and that it  appears  in  the
       latest version of the [1mreadline [22mlibrary that you have.

       Once  you have determined that a bug actually exists, mail a bug report
       to <bug-readline@gnu.org>.  If you have a fix, you are welcome to  mail
       that as well!  Please send suggestions and "philosophical" bug reports,
       as  well  as  comments  and bug reports concerning this manual page, to
       <bug-readline@gnu.org>.

